{% if icmp_only | length > 0 %}
## ICMP blocked but TCP open ({{ icmp_only | length }})

These answered on TCP but not ICMP. With the default `require_ping: true` they
were **held back from stage 3**. If that is just a firewall dropping pings,
rerun with `-e require_ping=false` to act on the TCP result alone.

